# Eggie uses Alacritty's terminal state machine and supports this entry's
# advertised control sequences. Keep the terminal name `alacritty`: programs
# such as Notcurses deliberately use it to select Alacritty-compatible
# capability workarounds after checking the secondary device attributes.
alacritty|Eggie terminal using the Alacritty core,
    use=xterm-256color,
    RGB, Tc,
    kbs=^?,
    rep=%p1%c\E[%p2%{1}%-%db,
    rmxx=\E[29m, smxx=\E[9m,
    ritm=\E[23m, sitm=\E[3m,
    Smulx=\E[4\:%p1%dm,
    Setulc=\E[58\:2\:\:%p1%{65536}%/%d\:%p1%{256}%/%{255}%&%d\:%p1%{255}%&%d%;m,
    Sync=\E[?2026%?%p1%{1}%-%tl%eh%;,
    Se=\E[2 q, Ss=\E[%p1%d q,
    BD=\E[?2004l, BE=\E[?2004h, PE=\E[201~, PS=\E[200~,
